              {searchQuery ? 'No messages found' : 'Start the conversation'}
            </h3>
            <p className="text-[#6B7280] dark:text-[#9CA3AF] max-w-sm">
              {searchQuery 
                ? 'Try adjusting your search terms'
                : 'Send a message to get the trip planning started!'
